<title>JAPAN: Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</title>
<headline>Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mikuni and Co Ltd said on Friday it had assigned the following preliminary ratings to planned bond issues:</p>
<p>-AA-</p>
<p>Kyushu Electric Power Co Inc, $300 million mortgaged due 2007.</p>
<p>Nippon Telegraph and Telephone Corp, $500 million mortgaged due 2002.</p>
<p>-A-</p>
<p>Tokyo Electric Power Co Inc, 100 billion yen mortgaged due 2007.  </p>
<p>-BBB-</p>
<p>Tokushu Paper Manufacturing Co Ltd, five billion yen unsecured convertible due 2001, private placement.</p>
<p>-B-</p>
<p>Orix Corp, 20 billion yen unsecured due 2009.</p>
<p>-CCC-</p>
<p>Focus Systems Corp, 25 million Swiss francs unsecured convertible due 2001, private placement.</p>
</text>
